# Every change needs a review from the maintainers. GitHub resolves the last
# matching pattern, so the catch-all comes first and the narrower rules below
# it win.
*                       @ioplane/maintainers

# The parts where a wrong change is expensive to notice.
#
# A behavioural claim about PowerDNS is only as good as the evidence behind it
# (AGENTS.md golden rule 3), and the contract is what users are entitled to
# rely on. Both are easy to edit and hard to un-ship.
/docs/contract.md       @ioplane/maintainers
/docs/adr/              @ioplane/maintainers
/docs/standards/        @ioplane/maintainers

# The release path publishes an immutable artefact, and the workflows are the
# only thing standing between a mistake and that artefact.
/.github/workflows/     @ioplane/maintainers
/.goreleaser.yml        @ioplane/maintainers
/scripts/               @ioplane/maintainers
